# 6. Install ECK Operator

Add the Elastic Helm repository:

```bash
helm repo add elastic https://helm.elastic.co
```

Update:

```bash
helm repo update
```

Check the chart:

```bash
helm search repo elastic/eck-operator
```

Install ECK:

```bash
helm install elastic-operator \
  elastic/eck-operator \
  -n elastic-system \
  --create-namespace
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get pods -n elastic-system
```

Expected:

```text
NAME                READY   STATUS
elastic-operator-0  1/1     Running
```

Check Helm:

```bash
helm list -n elastic-system
```

