# 22. Verify Controller Permissions

If you see an error such as:

```text
AccessDenied:
elasticloadbalancing:DescribeLoadBalancers
```

the controller does not have the required IAM permissions.

Do not simply add one ELB permission at a time.

The controller requires its complete IAM policy.

Check the controller logs:

```bash
kubectl logs \
  -n kube-system \
  deployment/aws-load-balancer-controller \
  --tail=100
```

