# 28. DNS Configuration

Create a DNS record:

```text
kibana.example.com
```

pointing to the ALB.

For Route 53, create an Alias record pointing to the ALB.

Then access:

```text
https://kibana.example.com
```

---

# 29. HTTP to HTTPS

If a user enters:

```text
http://kibana.example.com
```

the ALB should redirect to:

```text
https://kibana.example.com
```

This is important because Kibana requires a secure connection for authentication.

Do not expose Kibana login credentials over plain HTTP.

