## AccessDenied error

Example:

```text
AccessDenied:
elasticloadbalancing:DescribeLoadBalancers
```

This means the AWS Load Balancer Controller IAM permissions are incorrect.

Check:

```bash
kubectl logs \
  -n kube-system \
  deployment/aws-load-balancer-controller \
  --tail=100
```

Verify that the controller has its dedicated IAM role/policy.

