# 39. Recommended Production Improvements

The configuration above is suitable as a lab starting point.

For production, consider adding:

* HTTPS with ACM
* Route 53 DNS
* ALB security groups restricted to trusted CIDRs
* AWS WAF
* Separate Elasticsearch master and data roles
* Dedicated data nodes
* Elasticsearch resource requests/limits
* Pod anti-affinity
* Availability-zone awareness
* EBS GP3 IOPS/throughput tuning
* Snapshot repository
* S3 snapshot storage
* Kibana authentication/SSO
* Elastic Agent/Fleet
* Monitoring
* Alerting
* Backup and disaster recovery

Do not expose Kibana's login endpoint directly to the public Internet without appropriate TLS and access controls.

